/** @defgroup FMC_LL_Exported_Functions_NORSRAM FMC Low Layer NOR SRAM Exported Functions
  * @brief  NORSRAM Controller functions
  *
  @verbatim
  ==============================================================================
                   ##### How to use NORSRAM device driver #####
